   "data": {
    "text": "PLACEMENT\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 1, CC 97 to 112\n   1 Object\n   2 Object path\n   3 Object speed\n   4 Object in frame\n   5 Number of people\n   6 Where they stand\n   7 Eyelines\n   8 Who is sharp\n   9 Look of the actor\n  10 Empty frame\n  11 Foreshortening\n  12 suite: Power staging\n  13 suite: Alone in the frame\n  14 pair: When an object enters, the frame becomes an insert\n  15 pair: When people get closer, they hold each other's look\n  16 pairs: Closing in"
   },
